# Normative #542: an observer deadline detaches only delivery, a scheduler
# deadline terminally resolves engine state, and a transport timeout is an
# identified I/O result. The public error may be Timeout in all three cases,
# but the boundary source remains explicit and replayable. The observer and
# scheduler cases use raw inquiries so their scheduler Timeout remains distinct
# from raw command acceptance ambiguity.
